{
  "query": "// Storm events from April and May 2007\nStormEvents\n| where StartTime between (datetime(2007-04-01) .. datetime(2007-06-01))\n| project StartTime, EndTime, EpisodeId, EventId, State, EventType, InjuriesDirect,\n    DeathsDirect, DamageProperty, Source, BeginLocation, BeginLat, BeginLon,\n    EventNarrative, StormSummary\n| take 240",
